  "remarks": "TAi.092 Title: a) Mullah b) Maulavi. Designation: Governor of Ghazni Province under the Taliban regime. Associated with Mullah Jalil Haqqani (TI.H.34.01).  Believed to be in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area. Belongs to Popalzai tribe. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 27 Jul. 2010; Listing: Listed on 25 January 2001 (amended 18 Jul 2007, 21 Sep 2007, 13 Feb. 2012 and 31 Dec. 2013)",
